nd role_distributions c0003 (red) and c0004 (blue).\",\"span_id\":\"s0001\"},{\"assertion_ids\":[\"a4\"],\"classification\":\"assertive\",\"reason\":\"Span asserts a relation between red and blue peaks at the same node/view; supported by red_blue_peak_relation c0005 and its operand distributions c0003 and c0004 and node_origin c0002.\",\"span_id\":\"s0002\"}],\"schema\":\"attention_relational_grounded_auditor_v4_annotation\",\"unit_id\":\"ba69636f6d0017998470aef1\",\"unresolved_ambiguity\":false}",
